Documents (ICE):

    QualityNote, NCRRecord, MeasurementInformationContentEntity, RequirementSpecification, PlanSpecification, Identifier (subtypes: PartIdentifier, SerialIdentifier, WorkOrderIdentifier, NCRIdentifier, LotIdentifier), DescriptiveInformationContentEntity (for general text), DesignSpecification (drawings/WIs if you prefer)

Physical/Agents:

    MaterialArtifact (Assembly, PieceOfEquipment, MaterialComponent), Person, Organization (Supplier, Manufacturer)

Qualities (defects & states):

    Defect (as subclasses of quality), DefectSeverity, FailureCause (both as quality subclasses)

Places/Time:

    site, spatial region, temporal instant/interval

Processes/Events:

    MeasurementProcess, ManufacturingProcess/AssemblyProcess, PlannedProcess (for CorrectiveAction execution), Event (LineStop, SafetyEvent)

Realizable entities:

    disposition
